1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,280
You died ten seconds ago.

2
00:00:02,485 --> 00:00:03,610
Hi. I'm God.

3
00:00:03,875 --> 00:00:04,820
Heaven? Hell?

4
00:00:05,045 --> 00:00:06,230
Nope. You're going back.

5
00:00:06,455 --> 00:00:09,675
Over 100 billion people have ever lived.

6
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,145
Every single one of them... was you.

7
00:00:12,430 --> 00:00:14,755
Every killer. And every victim.

8
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,065
Why? Because you haven't been born yet.

9
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:19,435
When you've been everyone... you'll hatch.

10
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:20,440
As a god.

11
00:00:20,725 --> 00:00:22,465
Everything you've ever seen...

12
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:24,350
is just the inside of your egg.

13
00:00:24,575 --> 00:00:25,755
Subscribe to see more.
